' Choosing a weapon by hand, original rules. Take the axe at Nob Hill, then choose
' the knife with a right click in the room. The mutant: v0.9.1's
' UseBestEquipment keeps the choice unless the pack holds a better weapon
' that uses no ammunition — the axe — so the blow is the axe's, and the axe is
' what is chosen after it. Back in the room the frame is on the axe. Saved.
mapclick 19,292          ' sets out
mapclick 19,292          ' walk in
mapclick 253,201         ' the door of room 2
mapclick 253,201
uiclick 256,128          ' take the axe
rsceneclick 124,119      ' choose the knife: the red frame goes on it
esc
fight
mapclick 355,171         ' the mutant
hit
mapclick 253,201         ' back into room 2
mapclick 253,201
save
